  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_RedeDeCidadesSaudaveis
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Cidade entra na rede de Cidades Saud\xE1veis"
  _titleEn: City Joins the Healthy Cities Network
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Na rede de Cidades Saud\xE1veis, a prefeitura assume o compromisso pol\xEDtico
    de pensar a sa\xFAde em todas as \xE1reas, do transporte \xE0 moradia, junto
    com a popula\xE7\xE3o."
  _summaryEn: In the Healthy Cities network, City Hall makes a political commitment
    to weigh health in every area, from transit to housing, together with residents.
  _realWorld: "A rede europeia de Cidades Saud\xE1veis da OMS completou 30 anos em
    2018 e re\xFAne cerca de 100 cidades-membro e 30 redes nacionais, com uns 1.400
    munic\xEDpios."
  _realWorldEn: The WHO European Healthy Cities Network turned 30 in 2018 and brings
    together about 100 member cities and 30 national networks, covering some 1,400
    municipalities.
  _tradeOffs: "Entrar na rede \xE9 um compromisso, n\xE3o um resultado: medir o efeito
    na sa\xFAde \xE9 dif\xEDcil, e o selo vira s\xF3 propaganda se n\xE3o mudar as
    decis\xF5es."
  _tradeOffsEn: 'Joining is a commitment, not a result: measuring the health impact
    is hard, and the label becomes mere publicity if decisions do not change.'
  _sources:
  - Label: WHO European Healthy Cities Network (OMS)
    Url: https://www.who.int/europe/groups/who-european-healthy-cities-network
  - Label: Healthy city (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Healthy_city
